---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Contact — LinksMaxing"
  description="Talk to us. Every engagement starts with a real conversation."
  activeNav="contact"
>
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="page-eyebrow">Contact</div>
    <h1 class="page-title">Talk to <em>us.</em></h1>
    <p class="page-lead">The fastest way in is a short email or a booked call. We usually respond within one business day.</p>
  </div>

  <section class="block block-grid">
    <div class="block-meta">
      <div class="block-meta-num">01</div>
      <div class="block-meta-cat">Direct</div>
      <div class="block-meta-items">
        <div class="block-meta-item">harper@linksmaxing.com</div>
        <div class="block-meta-item">Dallas, TX</div>
        <div class="block-meta-item">By appointment</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="block-body">
      <h2 class="sec-head">Reach <em>Harper.</em></h2>
      <div class="article-body" style="border-top:none;padding-top:0;">
        <p><strong>Email —</strong> <a href="mailto:harper@linksmaxing.com">harper@linksmaxing.com</a></p>
        <p><strong>Phone —</strong> +1 214 · · · ····</p>
        <p><strong>Location —</strong> Dallas, Texas. In-person meetings by appointment.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block block-grid">
    <div class="block-meta">
      <div class="block-meta-num">02</div>
      <div class="block-meta-cat">What to send</div>
      <div class="block-meta-items">
        <div class="block-meta-item">One paragraph</div>
        <div class="block-meta-item"><strong>1</strong> business day reply</div>
        <div class="block-meta-item">No intake forms</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="block-body">
      <h2 class="sec-head">A short paragraph is <em>plenty.</em></h2>
      <div class="article-body" style="border-top:none;padding-top:0;">
        <p>Tell us your business name, what you sell, roughly where your customers are, and what you're trying to fix. We'll usually respond with a proposed time to talk or, if we already have enough context, a short scoping note.</p>
        <p>If you'd rather skip the email and book straight into a call, that works too.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-block">
    <h2 class="cta-head">Book a <em>call.</em></h2>
    <p class="cta-sub">Twenty minutes. No prep needed on your end.</p>
    <a href="mailto:harper@linksmaxing.com?subject=Booking%20a%20call" class="btn">Email to book →</a>
  </section>
</Layout>
